=== CONCLUSION ===
The exact closed form for phi_n^(6) in ATTEMPT.md Sec.1.2 is CORRECT
(independently re-derived and confirmed above and in
adv_k6_recursion_check.py). The document's claim that its 1/n
coefficient is 512/1001 ("matching 6*phi_6/4 exactly") is WRONG: the
true 1/n coefficient is 1093/6006, confirmed by FOUR independent
